<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-LEADING NORWEGIAN GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING NORWEGIAN GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in Norwegian</p>
<p>soccer after Thursday's matches:</p>
<p>9 - Stig Johansen (Bodoe/Glimt)</p>
<p>7 - Harald Brattbakk (Rosenborg)</p>
<p>6 - Morten Berre (Skeid)</p>
<p>5 - Tore Andre Flo (Brann), Daniel Berg Hestad (Molde)</p>
<p>Odd Inge Olsen (Molde), Sigurd Rushfeldt (Rosenborg)</p>
<p>Arild Stavrum (Stabaek), Jostein Flo (Stroemsgodset)</p>
<p>Patrick Karlsson (Tromsoe).</p>
</text>
